    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="structllvm_1_1_block_frequency_info_impl_base_1_1_distribution" kindref="compound">Distribution</ref> of unscaled probability weight. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="structllvm_1_1_block_frequency_info_impl_base_1_1_distribution" kindref="compound">Distribution</ref> of unscaled probability weight to a set of successors.</para>
<para>This class collates the successor edge weights for later processing.</para>
<para><emphasis>DidOverflow</emphasis> indicates whether <emphasis>Total</emphasis> did overflow while adding to the distribution. It should never overflow twice. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
